<% if @event.rsvp_needed? %>
EVENT UPDATE - RSVP REQUIRED - <%= @event.name %>
<% else %>
EVENT UPDATE - <%= @event.name %>
<% end %>
<%= @lounge.name %>

Hi <%= @member.first_name %>!

We wanted to let you know that our upcoming event, <%= @event.name %>, has been updated with new details.

UPDATED EVENT DETAILS:
=====================
Name: <%= @event.name %>

<% if @changed_attributes.include?(:date) %>
📅 UPDATED DATE: <%= @event.date.strftime("%A, %B %d, %Y") %>
<% else %>
Date: <%= @event.date.strftime("%A, %B %d, %Y") %>
<% end %>

<% if @changed_attributes.include?(:start_time) || @changed_attributes.include?(:end_time) %>
⏰ UPDATED TIME: <%= @event.start_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %> - <%= @event.end_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %>
<% else %>
Time: <%= @event.start_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %> - <%= @event.end_time.strftime("%I:%M %p") %>
<% end %>

Type: <%= @event.event_type %>

<% if @changed_attributes.include?(:description) %>
📝 UPDATED DESCRIPTION:
<%= @event.description %>
<% elsif @event.description.present? %>
Description:
<%= @event.description %>
<% end %>

<% if @event.rsvp_needed? && @rsvp_url %>
⚠️ RSVP REQUIRED FOR THIS EVENT:
===============================
Due to the event updates, please confirm your attendance by visiting this link:
<%= @rsvp_url %>

Your RSVP helps us plan the perfect experience.

Note: This RSVP link will expire 1 hour before the event starts.
<% else %>
We look forward to seeing you there! No RSVP required - just come and enjoy the updated experience.
<% end %>

LOCATION & CONTACT:
==================
Location: <%= @lounge.name %>
<% if @lounge.address_street_1.present? %>
Address: <%= @lounge.address_street_1 %>, <%= @lounge.city %>, <%= @lounge.state %> <%= @lounge.zip_code %>
<% end %>

Questions about these changes? Contact us at <%= @lounge.email %> or <%= @lounge.phone_number %>

---
This email was sent by <%= @lounge.name %>
Powered by Herf
